se-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736761244","position":3,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736761244","name":"3. Is mathematics compulsory for Data Science?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, mathematics is essential for Data Science. Topics like linear algebra, calculus, probability, and statistics are crucial for understanding machine learning models, performing data analysis, and making accurate predictions from datasets.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736775563","position":4,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736775563","name":"4. Who can study Data Science?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Anyone with an interest in mathematics, statistics, and programming can study Data Science. Both technical and non-technical students, graduates, and working professionals can pursue courses, certifications, or degrees in this field.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736791840","position":5,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736791840","name":"5. What is the duration of a Data Science course?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The duration of Data Science courses varies. Undergraduate courses are typically three years, postgraduate programs last two years, and certifications or diplomas range from three months to one year.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736806343","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736806343","name":"6. What skills are required to learn Data Science?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Key skills include mathematics, statistics, programming (Python or R), data visualization, machine learning, SQL, analytical thinking, problem-solving, and communication skills to interpret and present insights from data effectively.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736817612","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736817612","name":"7. What is the eligibility for a Data Science course?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Eligibility depends on the level of the course. Undergraduate courses require 10+2 with maths; postgraduate programs require a relevant degree, while certifications often have no strict prerequisites.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736830016","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736830016","name":"8. What career opportunities are available after completing the course?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"After completing Data Science courses, you can pursue careers as a Data Analyst, Data Scientist, Machine Learning Engineer, Business Analyst, Data Engineer, or work in AI, Big Data, and analytics domains.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736845960","position":9,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science-course-syllabus\/#faq-question-1775736845960","name":"9. Is Data Science a good career choice in India?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes,